usage: export_robocasa_rgbd_pose.py [-h] --raw-root RAW_ROOT --flat-root
                                    FLAT_ROOT --output-root OUTPUT_ROOT
                                    [--mapping-file MAPPING_FILE]
                                    [--source-dataset SOURCE_DATASET]
                                    (--selection-manifest SELECTION_MANIFEST | --global-episode GLOBAL_EPISODE | --local-episode LOCAL_EPISODE)
                                    [--task-class TASK_CLASS]
                                    [--cameras CAMERAS] --state-index-policy
                                    {frame_index}
                                    [--depth-format {uint16_mm,float32_m}]
                                    [--frames FRAMES]
                                    [--image-size IMAGE_SIZE]
                                    [--chunk-frames CHUNK_FRAMES]
                                    [--min-free-bytes MIN_FREE_BYTES]
                                    [--task-shard TASK_SHARD]
                                    [--num-task-shards NUM_TASK_SHARDS]
                                    [--episode-shard EPISODE_SHARD]
                                    [--num-episode-shards NUM_EPISODE_SHARDS]
                                    [--dry-run]

Export original RGB references, metric Depth and camera Pose by episode. Run
from the Root checkout: python -m tools.g2.export_robocasa_rgbd_pose --help
Real replay is server-side only. --dry-run loads mapping/nonvisual source
rows, but never imports RoboCasa/MuJoCo or creates a renderer.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --raw-root RAW_ROOT
  --flat-root FLAT_ROOT
  --output-root OUTPUT_ROOT
  --mapping-file MAPPING_FILE
  --source-dataset SOURCE_DATASET
                        explicit original lerobot directory when Task has
                        multiple datasets
  --selection-manifest SELECTION_MANIFEST
                        existing g0 accepted cache manifest or explicit
                        global-ID manifest
  --global-episode GLOBAL_EPISODE
  --local-episode LOCAL_EPISODE
  --task-class TASK_CLASS
  --cameras CAMERAS
  --state-index-policy {frame_index}
                        explicit assertion to be physically verified by DS;
                        never inferred from timestamps
  --depth-format {uint16_mm,float32_m}
  --frames FRAMES       comma-separated frame indices; omitted exports the
                        full mapped episode
  --image-size IMAGE_SIZE
                        optional assertion of original square RGB size; never
                        resizes source RGB
  --chunk-frames CHUNK_FRAMES
  --min-free-bytes MIN_FREE_BYTES
                        disk reserve checked before replay and each chunk
  --task-shard TASK_SHARD
  --num-task-shards NUM_TASK_SHARDS
  --episode-shard EPISODE_SHARD
  --num-episode-shards NUM_EPISODE_SHARDS
  --dry-run
